ss; इहाहं द्रष्टुमाह्वं तां स्मरन्नेवं मुमोह सः Bk.6.21;1.2;15.16.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "To be perplexed or bewildered, to be disturbed in mind, be at a loss; आपत्स्वपि न मुह्यन्ति नराः पण्डितबुद्धयः H.1.145; Ki. 18.9.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "To be foolish, stupid, or infatuated.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "To fail.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "To err, mistake. -Caus. (मोहयति-ते)", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "To stupefy, infatuate; मा मूमुहत् खलु भवन्तमनन्यजन्मा Māl.1. 32.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "To confound, bewilder, perplex; व्यामिश्रेणेव वाक्येन बुद्धिं मोहयसीव मे Bg.3.2;4.16.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "To throw into confusion.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "To cause to err or mistake.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["muh"], "synonyms_slp1": ["muh"]}]}